<title>UK: S&amp;P confirms rates DnB A l-term, A1 s-term.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P confirms rates DnB A l-term, A1 s-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it had assigned Norway's Den norske Bank a long term counterparty credit and senior debt rating of A, and a short term counterparty credit rating of A1.</p>
<p>&quot;Den norske Bank's ratings are based on the bank's leading position in the Norwegian banking industry, much improved asset quality, good profitability, satisfactory capitalisation and sound domestic franchise,&quot; S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit + 44 171 542 6137</p>
</text>
